PROBLEM: Petrochemical Facility Location

MINIMIZE
900 OpenA + 750 OpenB + 1100 OpenC + 4 SupplyA1 + 6 SupplyA2 + 5 SupplyA3 + 5 SupplyB1 + 3 SupplyB2 + 4 SupplyB3 + 7 SupplyC1 + 5 SupplyC2 + 3 SupplyC3

SUBJECT TO
SupplyA1 + SupplyA2 + SupplyA3 >= 0
SupplyB1 + SupplyB2 + SupplyB3 >= 0
SupplyC1 + SupplyC2 + SupplyC3 >= 0
SupplyA1 + SupplyB1 + SupplyC1 >= 80
SupplyA2 + SupplyB2 + SupplyC2 >= 100
SupplyA3 + SupplyB3 + SupplyC3 >= 70
SupplyA1 + SupplyA2 + SupplyA3 - 160 OpenA <= 0
SupplyB1 + SupplyB2 + SupplyB3 - 180 OpenB <= 0
SupplyC1 + SupplyC2 + SupplyC3 - 140 OpenC <= 0

BINARY
OpenA OpenB OpenC